# Slurm job logs — one pair per run, large and specific to a job id.
*.out

# Plots — regenerable from the JSONL beside them:
#   PYTHONPATH=. python scripts/visualization/visualize_forward_time_nd.py \
#       --input <stem>.jsonl --out <stem>.png
*.png
*.pdf

# The JSONL rows and BENCHMARK_RESULTS.md are the primary record and ARE tracked.

# Smoke / bring-up runs — superseded by the production sweeps, and some contain
# rows from since-fixed harness bugs. Kept on disk, out of the record.
*smoke*
